  "expensive_citus_matrix_policy": {
    "default_rule": "Batch meaningful work first. Do not spend a full Citus matrix run on every metadata-only rebase, doc-only conflict, or isolated sidecar smoke if the focused gate covers the changed runtime. Run the matrix at the batch boundaries and high-risk path triggers below.",
