      "A merge changes .github/workflows/build_and_test.yml, .github/workflows/run_tests.yml, packaging-test-pipelines.yml, or the Citus test-matrix fanout itself.",
      "A draft blocker is resolved by changing production runtime semantics rather than only metadata, docs, or CI wiring.",
      "The integrated branch is being considered for release promotion or for replacing bootstrap-v2 as the active release train."
    ],
    "do_not_run_when": [
      "Only this merge-plan JSON, its checker, or its Markdown companion changed.",
